Firmware
--------
The camera firmware is the property of OM Digital Solutions Corporation and is distributed by them under their
own licence. This repository contains no firmware bytes: no firmware file, no decoded partitions, no
disassembly, no copied tables, strings or icons. patch/looks56.json holds (a) our own new bytes, (b) build-time
instructions that copy ranges of the official image you download yourself, and (c) SHA-256 hashes of the
original ranges, used only to check that the right firmware is being patched. Reference LUT files from the
projects below are not included either; the look data we ship is a set of numbers (colour matrices and tone
curves) that we fitted ourselves to match them.

